@ browser.lp — Navigator module stub (v0.2 beta)
@
@ The full Browser API (Browser(), on Browser.Start, navigation events) is planned for v0.4.
@ This example verifies that `use navigator.` loads the built-in module stub today.

use navigator.

print "Navigator version: " with navigator.version.
print "Lang.P Navigator — desktop browser framework coming in a future release.".
